Homepage: https://github.com/vomlehn/tcslog
Description: makes tcslog logs to test with, and tcslog's examples
 Tcslog-gen writes chains of tcslog segment files, to test what reads
 them; it is a verification tool, and never flies. The package also
 holds the examples of tcslog's Rust, C, C++ and Python interfaces,
 which the tcslog package's library runs.
